    keyMessages:[
      'October closed at ₹45,43,190, fully tallied to the bank — ₹8.61L above the ₹36,81,763 forecast on 14 Oct. September is restated to ₹55,83,916 after a ₹66,942 bank adjustment.',
      'November: ₹7,00,728 expected in (Somika ₹6.17L, Tata ₹0.50L, 1:1 fees ₹0.34L) and ₹17,52,342 to pay out (salaries ₹6.92L, teacher payouts ₹5.22L, travel ₹3.05L). November is projected to close at ₹34,91,576.',
      'Base case stays positive through February 2027 (₹7.57L) and closes March 2027 at ₹(18.22L), ₹4.66L better than on 14 Oct. February and March pay out ₹60.20L with only ₹9.79L coming in.',
      'Pipeline scenarios close March 2027 at ₹23.43L, ₹45.52L and ₹47.87L (14 Oct: ₹28.96L, ₹65.24L and ₹68.81L). Invita has moved from Highly Likely to Medium Likely.',
      'The forecast now runs to June 2027: the base case reaches ₹(37.57L) in June 2027; with all pipeline it closes June at ₹61.51L.'
    ],
